# Normalize line endings to LF in the repo and in the working tree.
# This repo is developed in WSL; files edited from the Windows side across
# the \wsl.localhost share were being re-saved with CRLF, producing diffs
# that touched thousands of lines without changing any code.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Keep genuinely binary assets untouched.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.mp4 binary
*.glb binary
*.onnx binary
*.pt binary
*.pth binary
